; The four exports a COM in-process server has, and nothing else: the engine
; is linked into this DLL statically, and none of its symbols are anyone's
; business from outside.  The names must be undecorated, which is what this
; file is for -- at 32 bits __stdcall would otherwise export them as
; _DllGetClassObject@12 and regsvr32 would not find them.
LIBRARY tvsapi
EXPORTS
    DllCanUnloadNow PRIVATE
    DllGetClassObject PRIVATE
    DllRegisterServer PRIVATE
    DllUnregisterServer PRIVATE
